{'symbol': 'ALGN', 'date': '2021-05-18 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALIGN TECHNOLOGY ANNOUNCES $100 MILLION ACCELERATED STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': 'TEMPE, ARIZ., MAY 18, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ALIGN TECHNOLOGY, INC. (“ALIGN”) (NASDAQ: ALGN) A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL DEVICE COMPANY THAT DESIGNS, MANUFACTURES, AND SELLS THE INVISALIGN SYSTEM OF CLEAR ALIGNERS, ITERO INTRAORAL SCANNERS, AND EXOCAD CAD/CAM SOFTWARE FOR DIGITAL ORTHODONTICS AND RESTORATIVE DENTISTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A NEW ACCELERATED STOCK REPURCHASE AGREEMENT ("ASR") WITH\xa0GOLDMAN SACHS & CO LLC, TO REPURCHASE\xa0$100 MILLION\xa0OF ALIGN\'S COMMON STOCK UNDER ALIGN\'S NEW $1.0 BILLION\xa0STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAM ANNOUNCED ON\xa0MAY 13, 2021.'}